{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0713_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0713_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1ac968da43967c6e42f3d122613a3a99705c3c51e405017728e59d2fc51577f9", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌のタイアップ企画の仕事だ。\n瑞希は『デビル』に扮して撮影を……）", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0713_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0713_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "5bca40a728b0cd049cb5370f08e2f177faab1e5ac785b64273c3f85fdf4fad12", "ja": "あっは～ん。{$P$}、\n魅了しちゃうぞぉ～ん。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0713_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0713_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "b87abdb6dacd4c548be2fa2bf451e774edb65ca449408e499443932e865d8440", "ja": "うっふふふ～ん。……？\nおかしいな、この人間、魅了が通じないぞ。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0713_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0713_1004_p", "source_sha256": "293f90aedf070d46caa9e207e5102cd87fee0814339d476461ee91b42cba6624", "ja": "うーん……本当にその路線でいくつもりか？\nちょっと不安になってきたな……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0713_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0713_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "72d9030f86034bdc4e7ec717187c02c69f22f93fb57ed3626bdcaf1ab58167a0", "ja": "なんと。まさかの反応です。もしかして、\n私のセクシーが信頼できないということでしょうか？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0713_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0713_1006_p", "source_sha256": "eaf1da41a81934591cf457162a7773ce087d07d24057e8b63e6d2792f7a24c4a", "ja": "いや、そういうわけじゃないんだけど……\nあ、いや。そういうわけになるのか？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0713_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0713_1007_044miz", "source_sha256": "783fc77c12258a690b5046ea8aee862edad8b9655c35c30c54ff8695c8117cb3", "ja": "がーん。そこそこ自信があったのですが、これは\n困りました。ちょっと……いえ、かなりのショック。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0713_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0713_1008_p", "source_sha256": "9d4a7dc8e7a346c623a9dedf52bc2273b0870d4f864ea246e5d3a1b3c75a2899", "ja": "あ、えっと……悪い意味で捉えないでほしいんだ。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0713_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0713_1009_p", "source_sha256": "09977f728f3191b669f9ab2d7ff5a1240117d5e23550d32e61cd456b765d30ed", "ja": "たしかに衣装はセクシー系かもしれないけど、\n瑞希が無理してその路線で行くこともないと思ってる。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0713_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0713_1010_044miz", "source_sha256": "6117923c24175810f3cdd94097907d1e426581c119ed48da59f277ef11c56ad6", "ja": "……。しかし{$P$}、\nこの衣装を貰った時、私はひらめきました。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0713_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0713_1011_044miz", "source_sha256": "7fc3dad77e160f6e78d64fcf1548fc627308c1f4bef85c5f33cd09e4d8fd4c89", "ja": "トップアイドルを目指すうえで、\n私にはまだまだ欠けているものがあります。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0713_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0713_1012_044miz", "source_sha256": "5760bcb2f804244401176d71b37248c5ac0de0c9b8dbf421260aa89a990f28ad", "ja": "そのひとつを手に入れ、かつ世間に知らしめる……\nこの撮影こそ、そのチャンスだと思ったんです。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0713_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0713_1013_044miz", "source_sha256": "24e94a07129b43babd59623cdf99cc6a31b211a6c187da00a0cd496a688295ba", "ja": "だから、だから……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0713_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0713_1014_p", "source_sha256": "ce9805a06070f6dcfb10212be3690244e0c63d3a17f47e2eb004e79549d4fe17", "ja": "セクシー系で行きたい、と。うーん……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0713_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0713_1015_044miz", "source_sha256": "48d01f448cbc0fbb296be88216a9b0033ba1663d3445d52b38b279819a139833", "ja": "{$P$}……ダメですか？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0713_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0713_1016_p", "source_sha256": "80256d1c9aeeac0e02cd75b420208869beb01d3b351696694f72110275846efa", "ja": "！？\nぐっ……だ、ダメ……じゃありません……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0713_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0713_1017_044miz", "source_sha256": "de8489a852562f4bc5bf26dd97fff02067ffb7063331f5ea0c2a37bfd063bcd8", "ja": "言質を取りました。ふふふ……伊吹さんの言っていた\nとおりです。可愛いおねだりは、時に最大の武器。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0713_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0713_1018_044miz", "source_sha256": "b942a76e08b0b31d60c528c5be8b341fd43a2dbd641efe1ad2d52ffb94856b72", "ja": "おや？　もう本番ですか。{$P$}……\n「ずーっと目を離さないでね？　チュッ♪」", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0713_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0713_1019_p", "source_sha256": "6f795871f722dcdbb535abcd0c5a8b8bf71925ac5e935f96b2eece5188aca21e", "ja": "（翼に目をつけるとは、さすがだな。これは良い影響\n……いや悪影響？　瑞希の可能性は未知数すぎる……）", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
